---
// Bento Grid de capacidades y arquitectura del sistema
---

<section id="pilares" class="scroll-mt-24 py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <header class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand">
        Capacidades del Sistema
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl">
        Diseñado para la velocidad real de tu mostrador
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        Una arquitectura offline pensada para que nunca pierdas una venta ni dependas de servidores externos.
      </p>
    </header>

    {/* Bento Grid layout */}
    <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12">
      {/* Tarjeta 1: Motor Offline (Col span 7) */}
      <article
        class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-edge bg-surface p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-line hover:shadow-xl lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between"
      >
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-tint text-brand">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z" />
                <path d="m3 3 18 18" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700">
              <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
              Cero Caídas
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="mt-6 font-heading text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">
            100% Offline-First: Tu negocio no frena jamás
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
            Toda la base de datos vive embebida en tu propio equipo. Si se corta el cable, el WiFi o cae el proveedor de internet, la caja continúa facturando a máxima velocidad sin pantallas de carga ni errores.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* Micro-interfaz simulada de conexión */}
        <div class="relative z-10 mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-edge bg-surface-2 p-4">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="flex h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500"></span>
              <span class="font-medium text-ink-muted">Internet: <strong class="text-ink">Desconectado</strong></span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-emerald-700 font-semibold">
              <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
              <span>POS Operativo (12ms)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-edge/60 pt-3 text-[11px] text-ink-muted">
            <span>Transacciones guardadas localmente</span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-brand">Base SQLite Embebida</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      {/* Tarjeta 2: Cierre de Turno en PDF (Col span 5) */}
      <article
        class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-edge bg-surface p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-line hover:shadow-xl lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between"
      >
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-tint text-brand">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z" />
                <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8" />
                <line x1="16" x2="8" y1="13" y2="13" />
                <line x1="16" x2="8" y1="17" y2="17" />
                <polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-brand/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-brand">
              Instantáneo
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="mt-6 font-heading text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">
            Arqueo y Cierre en PDF
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
            Al finalizar el turno, un solo clic genera el resumen formal: efectivo, tarjetas, transferencias y balance cuadrado listo para imprimir o archivar.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* Mini ficha de reporte PDF simulada */}
        <div class="relative z-10 mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-edge bg-surface-2 p-4 font-mono text-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-edge/60 pb-2 text-[11px] text-ink-muted uppercase">
            <span>Resumen Turno</span>
            <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">Cuadrado ✓</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-[12px]">
            <div class="flex justify-between text-ink-muted">
              <span>Efectivo en Caja:</span>
              <span class="font-semibold text-ink">$142,500</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-ink-muted">
              <span>Tarjetas & Digital:</span>
              <span class="font-semibold text-ink">$152,300</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between border-t border-edge/60 pt-1.5 font-bold text-ink">
              <span>Total Cierre:</span>
              <span class="text-brand">$294,800</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      {/* Tarjeta 3: Control de Stock (Col span 5) */}
      <article
        class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-edge bg-surface p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-line hover:shadow-xl lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between"
      >
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-tint text-brand">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z" />
                <path d="m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5" />
                <path d="M12 22V12" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-surface-2 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-ink-muted">
              En Tiempo Real
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="mt-6 font-heading text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">
            Inventario y Catálogo Ágil
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
            Descuento automático de stock con cada venta. Control por categorías, alerta preventiva de stock mínimo y alta rápida de productos.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* Mini barra de stock */}
        <div class="relative z-10 mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-edge bg-surface-2 p-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="font-medium text-ink">Catálogo conectado</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-600">Stock sincronizado</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2.5 h-2 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-edge">
            <div class="h-full w-4/5 rounded-full bg-brand"></div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] text-ink-muted">Detección de productos críticos sin interrumpir la venta</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      {/* Tarjeta 4: Cero suscripciones y propiedad total (Col span 7) */}
      <article
        class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-edge bg-surface p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-line hover:shadow-xl lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between"
      >
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-tint text-brand">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2" />
                <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="rounded-full border border-brand-line bg-brand-tint px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-brand">
              Sin Alquileres Mensuales
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="mt-6 font-heading text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">
            Un solo pago. Sin sorpresas, sin nube, sin ataduras
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
            Los sistemas en la nube te cobran mes a mes y te bloquean el acceso si te atrasas. Con esta solución la licencia es tuya de por vida y toda la información de tus ventas permanece segura y privada en tu ordenador.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* Comparativa visual de ahorro */}
        <div class="relative z-10 mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-edge bg-surface-2 p-3.5">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-rose-600">Sistemas Cloud Típicos</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-base font-bold text-ink">$600 - $1,200 <span class="text-xs font-normal text-ink-muted">/ año</span></p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-ink-muted">Cuotas obligatorias y riesgo de suspensión</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-brand-line bg-brand-tint/60 p-3.5">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand">Este Sistema POS</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-base font-bold text-ink">Pago Único <span class="text-xs font-normal text-brand font-semibold">(De por vida)</span></p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-ink-muted">Software tuyo, datos tuyos, $0 extras</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
